# The generated views and references are compared BYTE-FOR-BYTE by their own
# --check scripts. With core.autocrlf=true a Windows checkout rewrote every
# file to CRLF, so `npm run check:docs` failed on a pristine clone and
# gen-views' H1 strip silently stopped matching. One line ending for everyone.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary, never converted.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.pyc binary
